      "writtenOn": "2021-08-11T08:17:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would be the benefit of distinguish between HEADSET and SPEAKER ? For Audio Manager it\u0027s only kind of figure that play roles in policy and routing. Representative device doesn\u0027t describe appearance of whole group.\n\nThere is also an issue that I\u0027ve raised 3 comments before - what if in group of devices appearances would be mixed that wouldn\u0027t be clear what type should it be.",
      "parentUuid": "397bad3b_8ed11587",
      "range": {
